  course: Old Forge Marathon
  geometry: data/import/raw/old-forge-marathon.gpx
  vouched: manual — Organizer&apos;s course-maps page (trisignup.com/Race/OldForgeHalfMarathon5K/Page/coursemaps, run by Willow Running / Willow Health &amp; Wellness Center) links a MapMyRun route (mapmyrun.com/routes/view/806208063) for the full marathon. MapMyRun&apos;s own robots.txt does not disallow the base /routes/view/ path or any file extension — genuinely permissive, unlike RideWithGPS/RunningAhead/plotaroute, all of which explicitly block automated access. The route&apos;s track (lat/lng/elevation, 1147 points) is embedded directly in the plain server-rendered HTML with no login required — verified by fetching the page directly. Hand-extracted the embedded points array into a clean single-track GPX (saved at routeUrl, gitignored raw input, not committed). Measured 43.046 km before parsing, real elevation present throughout. Retrieved 2026-08-18. Confirmed running 2026-09-12.
  elevation: gpx
  format in: gpx-trk
-->
